  "solution": "Given equation: 272 ÷ 17 − 196 ÷ ( 5 × 3 + 1) = 30 .\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) × and −\n\nGiven: 272 ÷ 17 − 196 ÷ (5 × 3 + 1) = 30 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 272 ÷ 17 × 196 ÷ (__**5 - 3 + 1**__) = 30 \n\n⇒ __**272 ÷ 17**__ × __**196 ÷ 3**__ = 30 \n\n⇒ __**16 × 65.33**__ = 30 \n\n⇒ 1045.28 ≠ 30\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) × and +\n\nGiven: 272 ÷ 17 − 196 ÷ ( 5 × 3 + 1) = 30 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 272 ÷ 17 − 196 ÷ (5 + __**3 × 1**__) = 30 \n\n⇒ 272 ÷ 17 − 196 ÷ (__**5 + 3**__) = 30 \n\n⇒ __**272 ÷ 17**__ − __**196 ÷ 8**__ = 30 \n\n⇒ __**16 − 24.5**__ = 30 \n\n⇒ -8.5 ≠ 30\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) + and ÷\n\nGiven: 272 ÷ 17 − 196 ÷ ( 5 × 3 + 1) = 30 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 272 + 17 − 196 + (__**5 × 3 ÷ 1**__) = 30 \n\n⇒ __**272 + 17 **__− 196 __**+ 15**__ = 30 \n\n⇒ __**304**____** − 196**__ = 30 \n\n⇒ 108 ≠ 30\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 4) + and −**\n\nGiven: 272 ÷ 17 − 196 ÷ ( 5 × 3 + 1) = 30 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 272 ÷ 17 + 196 ÷ (__**5 × 3**__ - 1) = 30 \n\n⇒ 272 ÷ 17 + 196 ÷ __**(15 - 1)**__ = 30 \n\n⇒ __**272 ÷ 17**__ + __**196 ÷ **____14__ = 30 \n\n⇒ __16** + **__**__14__**= 30 \n\n**⇒ 30 = 30**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
